abstract: >
  MedAgentX is a governance-first, deterministic, and replayable multi-agent
  clinical intelligence architecture designed to support clinicians without
  enabling autonomous diagnosis or treatment. The system introduces a Clinical
  Responsibility Firewall (CRF) as a first-class architectural primitive,
  deterministic execution graphs, counterfactual and replay-driven auditability,
  and bounded persistence layers that preserve clinician responsibility while
  improving contextual reasoning support.
